# Protect live secret accessors from clasp push deletion (folder-mirror sync).
# Incident 2026-09-06: clasp push deleted an editor-only Credentials.gs in a
# sibling project, breaking @HEAD/@9. THAT incident did NOT affect this project.
# Verified 2026-09-24: this project has NO Credentials file, locally or live,
# so a push here is delete-free. This guard is preventive only.
# Edit secrets in the Apps Script editor, never via clasp.
